  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73ff519377b990a4c81cd1461a3c1f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lito_W26_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Lito
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dec1559c1c146ff4c8cb2f55c759d194, type: 3}
  dialogueText: "No dumawatka iti maysa a tao a mangted iti maysa a banag kenka,
    mabalinmo nga agusar iti 'ikanmo man...'\n\nKayatna a saoen ti 'give me...' ken
    kalpasanna, iyungetmo ti banag a kayatmo.\n\nKas pagarigan: 'ikanmo man map'\u2014'give
    me the map.'\n\nDenggem a naimbag: ikanmo man map.\n\nIta, padasem nga ibagam
    ti 'ikanmo man' ken kalpasanna ti nagan ti banag a kayatmo."
  translatedText: 'When asking someone to hand you an object, you can use ''ikanmo
    man...''

    It means ''give me...'' and you add the item you want afterward.

    For
    example: ''ikanmo man map'' - ''give me the map.''

    Now, try saying ''ikanmo
    man ___'' yourself.'
